{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel across dimensions to stop the collapse of the energy core!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>diving deep into corrupted realms to destroy sinister energy-draining altars and face the mastermind behind the chaos. From scorched deserts to futuristic worlds, each jump through the rift is a high-stakes battle for survival.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time is running out. Dimensions are crumbling. Will you be the one to end this interdimensional disaster?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Explore Multiversal Worlds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore diverse, perilous realms</strong> and face off against <strong>ever-evolving foes and colossal behemoth bosses!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey through uniquely themed dimensions:</strong> from <strong>desolate ruins</strong> and <strong>gloom-shrouded forests</strong> to a <strong>cruel mechanical metropolis</strong>... <strong>Encounter a wild cast of enemies:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grooving little zombies</strong> lost in the beat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>music-obsessed chubby fellow</strong> (<i>Warning: Interrupt his headphones at your peril!</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>badass biker babe</strong> roaring on her ride</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>menagerie of cute-yet-ugly weird little monsters</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/b97aae0f05fa3acb9b38229de9112d51.poster.avif?t=1759883996\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/b97aae0f05fa3acb9b38229de9112d51.webm?t=1759883996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/b97aae0f05fa3acb9b38229de9112d51.mp4?t=1759883996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Play Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game features multiple playable characters, each with unique classes for you to choose from.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of characters, each a unique force that bends the rules of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cThese aren\u2019t classes\u2014they\u2019re variables in a system on the brink.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/43f34dce9ca62ab6c7b3c6970cd6a235.avif?t=1759883996\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Customize Your Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear System \u2013 Collect fragments of energy cores from different worlds to craft powerful new equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companion System \u2013 Tap into the shattered power of broken altars to forge your ultimate support allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/c37c9893255c9ba605c7fd5a7f6fba33.poster.avif?t=1759883996\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/c37c9893255c9ba605c7fd5a7f6fba33.webm?t=1759883996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/c37c9893255c9ba605c7fd5a7f6fba33.mp4?t=1759883996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Epic Boss Fights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against the Dimension Reaper, Kaos, a villain who manipulates rifts to devour entire worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-phase Boss Battles \u2013 Kaos summons echoes of fallen worlds and uses powerful skills like rift teleportation and energy siphoning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/0b0dfa9f90b13ffe5069f4a547f8b561.poster.avif?t=1759883996\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/0b0dfa9f90b13ffe5069f4a547f8b561.webm?t=1759883996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/extras/0b0dfa9f90b13ffe5069f4a547f8b561.mp4?t=1759883996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3767340?t=1759883996","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3767340?t=1759883996","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/823892a4cd4778b96234957353a4b2529d207f9a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759883996","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767340/823892a4cd4778b96234957353a4b2529d207f9a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759883996","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3815630,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel across dimensions to stop the collapse of the energy core!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>diving deep into corrupted realms to destroy sinister energy-draining altars and face t